</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib36.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Transactions of the Association for Computational Linguistics</em>,
2:67–78, 2014.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib37" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zheng et al. (2022)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Chuanyang Zheng, Kai Zhang, Zhi Yang, Wenming Tan, Jun Xiao, Ye Ren, Shiliang
Pu, et al.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Savit: Structure-aware vision transformer pruning via collaborative
optimization.

</span>
